    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d6-a8">

                <pb facs="0056" n="50" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg50"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Her Britannic Majesty’s Ship Carysport</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Woahoq</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1843-02-18"><hi rendition="#italic">February
                                18, 1843</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have had the honor to acknowledge Your
                    Majesty’s letter of this day’s date, wherein you intimate your intention of
                    complying with my demands, which I have considered my duty to make on Your
                    Majesty’s Government, I appoint the hour of 2 o’clock this afternoon for the
                    interchange of salutes, and I shall expect that you will inform me at what hour
                    on Monday you will be prepared to receive myself and Her Britannic Majesty’s
                    Representative.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be Your Majesty’s most obedient humble servant,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">George Paulet</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Captain.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Majesty <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tamehameha III</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
